<title>SPAIN: Spain approves sale of 52 pct of Sefanitro.</title>
<headline>Spain approves sale of 52 pct of Sefanitro.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's government approved on Friday the sale of 52 percent of the chemical group Sefanitro to fertiliser group Fertiberia as the State Industrial Agency (AIE) had proposed.</p>
<p>In November, Fertiberia offered to buy the stake at 630 pesetas per share, increasing its offer after a counterbid made by a group of minority shareholders and Norsk Hydro.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
